    "body": "This domain parsing section seems to be getting a bit long and similar to https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#is-a-registrable-domain-suffix-of-or-is-equal-to. Could we just call that algo instead and return failure if it returns false since it includes host-parsing the domain, handling the PSL which would fix https://github.com/WICG/cookie-store/issues/245, and some of the U+002E (.) parsing. Does that seem okay @annevk? ",
